 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m    Webhooks retry on their own now, so a flaky endpoint no longer drops 
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m    events.
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m    ✨ Added
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m    - Failed webhook deliveries retry with backoff for up to an hour.
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m    - `pigeon replay <id>` resends any delivery from the last 30 days.
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m    🐛 Fixed
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m    - The dashboard no longer shows a delivery twice after a reconnect.
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m    - Signing secrets with a trailing newline are accepted again.
 [38;2;95;215;175m│[39m
 [38;2;95;215;175m?[39m  [1mRelease with these notes?[22m
